Maintainer: edulution.io <info@netzint.de>
Changed-By: Lukas Spitznagel <lukas.spitznagel@netzint.de>
Description:
 edulution-linbo-vdi - VDI service for linuxmuster.net on Proxmox
Changes:
 edulution-linbo-vdi (1.1.8) noble; urgency=medium
 .
   * New optional hvHostname: the Proxmox certificate is checked against this
     DNS name while connecting to hvIp, for hosts reached by IP whose
     certificate carries no IP (closes #22). vdi-setup offers it after an IP
     mismatch and restarts an already running service so a changed
     configuration takes effect.
   * The service logs once per VM when the QEMU guest agent does not answer,
     naming the VM option and the token privilege (closes #23). The image
     docs explain the agent's virtio-serial dependency and how to enable the
     option on templates built before 1.1.2.
   * vdi-setup writes two master VMIDs and rejects duplicates, overlaps with
     the clone range, IDs of other VDI groups and IDs already used as clone
     VMIDs in devices.csv; a one-ID group config is loaded with a warning
     (closes #27).
   * certifi 2026.10.19 in the development lock file (PYSEC-2026-4320).
